WEBVTT

00:01.750 --> 00:02.560
It burns.

00:02.560 --> 00:05.720
The burning feeling pulses inside me.

00:05.720 --> 00:06.520
It hurts.

00:06.520 --> 00:07.740
It makes me numb.

00:07.740 --> 00:10.080
Is it from Johan’s attack?

00:10.080 --> 00:11.220
No.

00:11.220 --> 00:13.670
This burning... This pain...

00:13.670 --> 00:14.730
It’s...

00:14.730 --> 00:16.410
It hurts, Ayako-san.

00:16.410 --> 00:19.250
It hurts so much, I feel like my heart will shred.

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:50.000 --> 01:53.130
Ayako’s Boyfriend

01:52.050 --> 01:53.130
Ayako-san...

01:54.110 --> 01:54.900
No...

01:54.900 --> 01:56.330
Ayako-san!

01:56.330 --> 01:58.060
Don’t make that face!

01:58.060 --> 02:00.550
No... No...

02:00.550 --> 02:03.740
No! No!

02:12.120 --> 02:13.820
Emelenzia?

02:14.710 --> 02:15.610
Yes.

02:15.610 --> 02:16.730
You’re awake?

02:17.620 --> 02:20.550
Um, are you OK?

02:20.550 --> 02:23.830
Actually, I’m used to this sort of accident.

02:23.830 --> 02:30.260
And, Yoshimura Mamoru, “Are you OK?”
is the question I’d pose to you.

02:30.260 --> 02:38.230
Witch Beatrice believes that you failed to
control your beatrice and collapsed.

02:38.230 --> 02:39.310
Yeah.

02:39.310 --> 02:41.250
Does it not bother you?

02:46.860 --> 02:49.110
That was a foolish question...

02:49.110 --> 02:53.630
Ayako-san would never go to Germany.

02:53.630 --> 02:56.250
She hates Johan.

02:56.890 --> 02:59.190
Even if her uncle is there...

02:59.190 --> 03:04.070
Even if the research is appealing,
she wouldn’t...

03:04.070 --> 03:07.520
My brother should be explaining his research

03:07.520 --> 03:10.210
in the student council room right now.

03:10.210 --> 03:12.080
Thank you, Emelenzia!

03:14.850 --> 03:16.650
It’s still a bit cold, OK?

03:17.920 --> 03:18.820
See you!

03:23.470 --> 03:24.760
Danke.

03:25.740 --> 03:29.100
<i>Yes... I need to believe in Ayako-san.</i>

03:29.800 --> 03:35.430
<i>Ayako-san will refuse his offer.</i>

03:36.650 --> 03:39.170
I’d like you cooperate with us.

03:40.410 --> 03:42.280
I’m sorry!

03:42.280 --> 03:43.340
Mamoru?

03:43.340 --> 03:45.030
Are you OK?

03:45.030 --> 03:45.540
How do you feel?

03:45.540 --> 03:48.110
We’re in the middle of a discussion, Witch Beatrice.

03:49.680 --> 03:51.940
What is your answer?

03:56.600 --> 03:58.360
Let me consider it.

03:59.320 --> 04:01.180
H-Hey, Ayako!

04:02.600 --> 04:05.300
I look forward to your answer.

04:23.170 --> 04:26.530
Ayako, are you seriously going to accept his offer?

04:26.530 --> 04:28.110
Didn’t you hear?

04:28.110 --> 04:30.620
I said, “Let me consider it.”

04:30.620 --> 04:34.230
I didn’t say I was or wasn’t going.

04:34.230 --> 04:37.760
Isn’t not denying it the same as agreeing?

04:38.970 --> 04:42.740
It’s too cowardly to run away with a vague answer!

04:42.740 --> 04:44.600
Shione, calm down.

04:47.770 --> 04:48.660
Mamoru-kun.

04:49.540 --> 04:50.990
Take this.

04:50.010 --> 04:52.110
A Return to the Beginning

04:54.480 --> 04:57.190
A return to the beginning?

04:56.780 --> 05:03.790
A Return to the Beginning

04:57.560 --> 04:59.060
Yes.

04:59.060 --> 05:03.660
Johan said that beatrice...

05:03.660 --> 05:07.090
Beatrice have a will of their own.

05:07.090 --> 05:12.190
But that will is too small to read.

05:09.930 --> 05:17.710
A Return to the Beginning

05:12.190 --> 05:17.710
So they link millions and billions of them together.

05:17.710 --> 05:22.880
Then they function as a single life form.

05:22.880 --> 05:28.660
And they speak to us of their own mysteries.

05:29.510 --> 05:33.970
I don’t get it. Turning beatrice into a living being?

05:33.970 --> 05:35.420
Communicate?

05:35.420 --> 05:37.600
Are they going to talk or something?

05:37.600 --> 05:39.310
Fighting Spirit!

05:39.310 --> 05:42.940
A man speaks with his fist!

05:46.100 --> 05:47.470
<i>Ayako-san...</i>

05:51.240 --> 05:55.380
Kikukawa’s daughter
has a piano recital today.

05:59.960 --> 06:00.700
Um...

06:00.700 --> 06:02.790
I think I understand Masaki’s feelings.

06:03.470 --> 06:07.440
I thought I couldn’t believe him,

06:07.440 --> 06:09.650
that I couldn’t forgive him,

06:09.650 --> 06:14.750
for leaving me for research in Germany.

06:14.750 --> 06:20.770
But that research is appealing.

06:22.340 --> 06:24.700
If that’s really all...

06:25.400 --> 06:28.180
<i>If A Return to the Beginning
is simply to appeal to her,</i>

06:28.180 --> 06:31.570
<i>it’s sad, but I can support her.</i>

06:32.410 --> 06:34.080
<i>But...</i>

06:34.080 --> 06:35.760
Mamoru?

06:37.380 --> 06:43.210
Do you want me to not go to Germany?

06:47.020 --> 06:49.430
It’s not fair!

06:50.900 --> 06:52.810
What do you mean, not fair?

06:52.810 --> 06:55.170
Shione-san said it, too!

06:55.170 --> 06:57.280
You’ve already decided your answer.

06:57.280 --> 06:58.730
Wait, Mamoru. That’s—

06:58.730 --> 07:00.810
You’re afraid of him.

07:01.370 --> 07:06.060
You want to go to Germany.

07:06.060 --> 07:09.910
But what worries you is that, if you go,

07:09.910 --> 07:12.770
you could fall in love with him. Am I wrong?!

07:16.190 --> 07:20.330
I love you.

07:20.330 --> 07:21.750
More than anyone.

07:22.590 --> 07:26.610
Yes, I am afraid of him.

07:27.390 --> 07:33.480
Even so, it gets hot inside my chest,
and my heart starts pounding.

07:33.480 --> 07:40.010
The beatrice in my heart sought him on their own.

07:41.360 --> 07:44.870
I’ve never liked him.

07:44.870 --> 07:46.140
I can swear to that.

07:47.450 --> 07:49.250
But...

07:49.250 --> 07:54.410
My beatrice are drawn to him, regardless.

07:54.410 --> 07:56.420
I can’t help it.

07:56.420 --> 07:58.930
They seek him out...

08:01.830 --> 08:06.670
Please say something...

08:07.840 --> 08:09.360
Mamoru...

08:10.320 --> 08:17.050
I don’t know what to say.

08:19.020 --> 08:20.930
Now stopping at Ukishima Station!

08:21.370 --> 08:23.040
Ukishima Station.

08:40.030 --> 08:44.610
<i>Ayako-san’s beatrice want Johan.</i>

08:44.610 --> 08:49.150
<i>I knew I wasn’t worthy of her.</i>

08:49.150 --> 08:50.280
<i>Johan is...</i>

08:50.750 --> 08:53.090
What are you doing, lying there, Mamoru?

08:54.210 --> 08:57.270
Isn’t it a bit late for a rebellious phase?

08:58.130 --> 09:00.660
I don’t want to hear you say that.
You’re younger than I am.

09:01.790 --> 09:05.560
You didn’t eat much last night, either.

09:05.560 --> 09:07.080
Did something happen?

09:07.080 --> 09:08.980
Not really.

09:09.000 --> 09:10.730
You’re heavy.

09:10.730 --> 09:12.050
I know, Mamoru!

09:12.050 --> 09:14.570
You could eat your favorite shortcake, right?

09:14.570 --> 09:17.360
I don’t want anything sweet.

09:17.360 --> 09:20.590
What if it were with Maya-san and Shione-san?

09:23.130 --> 09:28.010
Tonight at midnight, Johan will unveil
his <i>Return to the Beginning</i>.

09:28.010 --> 09:30.610
Wasn’t that still at the research stage?

09:30.610 --> 09:36.460
It’s a very small-scale experiment. He claims if he’s with Witch Beatrice, he can do it.

09:37.140 --> 09:40.030
Ayako-san agreed?

09:40.030 --> 09:42.700
This is her decision.

09:43.280 --> 09:46.020
Before she decides whether to go to Germany,

09:46.020 --> 09:50.070
she wants to see the research for herself.

09:50.070 --> 09:51.680
Mamoru-san...

09:51.680 --> 09:53.900
Mamoru-kun, come with us.

09:54.970 --> 10:00.790
But even if I go, I’ll cause problems for her.

10:02.040 --> 10:03.320
Shione-san?

10:03.320 --> 10:05.920
Ayako’s such a bad girl.

10:05.920 --> 10:10.430
She’s violent, single-minded,
ungrateful, and a troublemaker.

10:10.430 --> 10:17.470
But her passion to uncover beatrice’s mysteries
is stronger than anyone’s.

10:18.400 --> 10:25.180
A while ago, she would’ve gone without hesitation,
no matter what anyone said to stop her.

10:26.050 --> 10:33.320
She isn’t giving a clear answer because she doesn’t
want to be separated from you, Mamoru.

10:35.000 --> 10:36.490
That’s right.

10:36.490 --> 10:41.490
<i>My beatrice are drawn to him, regardless.</i>

10:41.490 --> 10:46.490
<i>I can’t help it. They seek him out...</i>

10:47.200 --> 10:51.080
<i>The beatrice do the opposite of what
her own emotions dictate.</i>

10:51.080 --> 10:54.670
<i>She’s hurting more than anyone.</i>

10:54.670 --> 10:58.380
<i>But I...</i>

11:02.680 --> 11:04.500
Thank you for the meal.

11:04.500 --> 11:06.360
That was good tea.

11:06.360 --> 11:12.010
But you should add the leaves when
the water is a little more lukewarm.

11:20.670 --> 11:22.280
Off-Limits

11:20.670 --> 11:22.280
No Trespassing

11:29.710 --> 11:30.830
Mamoru?

11:36.440 --> 11:38.030
Emelenzia!

11:38.030 --> 11:39.020
Where’s Ayako-san?

11:42.720 --> 11:46.090
You’re just a bit late, then?

11:47.220 --> 11:48.660
Ayako-san.

11:50.830 --> 11:52.100
Witch Beatrice,

11:52.100 --> 11:56.030
I won’t ask why you’re so haggard.

11:56.030 --> 11:57.800
But don’t worry.

11:57.800 --> 12:03.700
I’ll give you a bigger sparkle

12:04.460 --> 12:06.710
than you’ve ever felt.

12:06.710 --> 12:07.580
What are you doing?

12:08.780 --> 12:15.450
This is a Beatrice Cluster that
Masaki and I created in Germany.

12:15.450 --> 12:16.820
Beatrice...

12:17.570 --> 12:21.720
We’ll use this as a core to birth a beatrice life form.

12:22.720 --> 12:29.690
What we’re creating is far, far smaller
than what Masaki and I seek.

12:30.400 --> 12:33.970
Until now, we haven’t even
been able to do this, but...

12:35.100 --> 12:37.080
Witch Beatrice,

12:37.080 --> 12:41.280
if you and I are together,
nothing in this world is impossible.

12:41.280 --> 12:43.570
Now give me your hand.

13:21.800 --> 13:23.400
We failed.

13:27.990 --> 13:30.060
Sudou Maya!

13:30.060 --> 13:32.540
Seal off the school immediately!

13:32.540 --> 13:35.460
You have that authority!

13:35.460 --> 13:39.090
At this rate, it will escape the academy!

13:40.120 --> 13:42.610
Whose fault is this?

13:42.610 --> 13:44.170
Warning! Warning!

13:44.170 --> 13:46.050
This is not a drill.

13:46.050 --> 13:48.110
Repeat: This is not a drill.

13:48.110 --> 13:49.780
Defense status level S.

13:49.780 --> 13:50.840
Activating defense barrier.

13:50.840 --> 13:55.110
Reroute all electricity on island city to barrier system at highest priority.

13:55.110 --> 13:56.190
Activating barrier.

13:57.210 --> 13:58.890
Strengtening area block.

13:58.890 --> 14:02.130
Sealing Academy City until system activation.

14:04.030 --> 14:07.500
Beatrice coefficient rising around Tokyo Bay.

14:07.500 --> 14:09.610
This is a different pattern than usual.

14:09.610 --> 14:10.990
Initiating detection routines.

14:12.160 --> 14:18.890
Routine completed: ID Number 021132, Johan’s protoblast pattern.

14:19.960 --> 14:22.380
Numbers rising slowly.

14:22.380 --> 14:25.730
The barrier’s noise is blocking out the details.

14:25.730 --> 14:29.500
No response from Johan. No mayday issued.

14:30.650 --> 14:33.690
I’m coming, Brother.

14:33.690 --> 14:35.920
Witch Beatrice, help me!

14:37.670 --> 14:39.270
I can’t.

14:39.270 --> 14:40.840
I can’t...

14:40.840 --> 14:41.970
I don’t understand.

14:41.970 --> 14:43.540
Why?

14:43.540 --> 14:46.820
I can’t connect with the beatrice...

14:46.820 --> 14:48.470
Ayako-san!

14:54.910 --> 14:56.710
Shione, this way!

14:56.710 --> 14:58.050
Right, Brother!

14:58.050 --> 14:59.210
Emelenzia!

14:59.210 --> 15:00.220
Help me!

15:00.220 --> 15:01.390
Yes!

15:10.560 --> 15:12.180
Ayako-san!

15:15.070 --> 15:16.430
Ayako-san...

15:18.480 --> 15:19.670
Mamoru...

15:20.740 --> 15:21.730
It’s coming!

15:21.730 --> 15:22.770
Take care of them!

15:22.770 --> 15:23.870
But...

15:23.870 --> 15:25.570
No, it’s too late!

15:25.570 --> 15:27.220
Witch Beatrice!

15:48.150 --> 15:49.840
Ayako-san?

15:49.840 --> 15:51.340
Are you OK?

15:51.340 --> 15:52.390
Ayako-san?

15:53.580 --> 15:55.510
I knew it...

15:56.210 --> 15:59.340
I knew it... It was just as I thought.

16:00.620 --> 16:05.620
I knew <i>Return to the Beginning</i> wouldn’t work.

16:06.960 --> 16:12.590
And then I couldn’t shake... I couldn’t think...

16:12.590 --> 16:16.030
I couldn’t connect with the beatrice.

16:16.030 --> 16:20.100
I couldn’t protect even myself, let alone Mamoru.

16:21.270 --> 16:24.370
But why?

16:24.370 --> 16:26.010
Why do I...

16:26.740 --> 16:33.040
Just thinking I might lose you destroys
all my pride and self-confidence!

16:33.580 --> 16:36.780
No matter how much my beatrice want Johan,

16:36.780 --> 16:43.190
without you there, I’m weaker than anyone!

16:47.300 --> 16:50.180
Yesterday, you told me to say something.

16:52.100 --> 16:55.340
There was a lot I wanted to say...

16:55.340 --> 16:57.300
A lot I wanted to apologize for.

16:57.300 --> 17:00.540
But just one thing...

17:03.200 --> 17:06.980
I don’t want you to go to Germany.

17:10.010 --> 17:12.840
I’m sorry for being selfish.

17:12.840 --> 17:16.730
I know I should support you.

17:16.730 --> 17:18.390
But...

17:18.390 --> 17:21.730
Those were the words I wanted to hear.

17:21.730 --> 17:22.430
Ayako-san...

17:41.740 --> 17:42.380
What?

17:43.750 --> 17:45.140
Mamoru!

17:45.140 --> 17:46.530
Witch Beatrice!

17:46.530 --> 17:47.420
You’re safe?

17:47.420 --> 17:49.110
You’re late.

17:49.110 --> 17:50.690
My arms are getting tired.

17:51.560 --> 17:55.280
Eliminate it now,

17:55.280 --> 17:58.150
with a single attack that won’t allow it to regenerate.

18:01.350 --> 18:02.860
Ayako!

18:02.860 --> 18:04.640
The barrier’s nearly at its limit.

18:05.370 --> 18:09.000
Blast the heck out of it with everything you’ve got.

18:09.000 --> 18:11.980
Brother, “blast the heck out of it” is inappropriate.

18:12.990 --> 18:15.410
Everything I’ve got, huh?

18:15.410 --> 18:18.080
Let me work with you.

18:22.760 --> 18:25.690
Like you did during the School Fair.

18:25.690 --> 18:27.970
Touch my beatrice.

18:27.970 --> 18:29.260
Can you do it?

18:29.260 --> 18:30.390
I can.

18:30.390 --> 18:32.180
Do your best.

18:32.180 --> 18:32.880
Right!

18:42.600 --> 18:48.420
Mamoru, put everything you have into it,
without the slightest hesitation.

18:49.280 --> 18:53.070
I still can’t beat Johan.

18:53.070 --> 18:54.550
But...

18:55.140 --> 18:57.050
I will get stronger.

18:57.050 --> 18:59.060
Yes, Mamoru.

18:59.060 --> 19:02.100
You’re going to become stronger than anyone.

19:02.100 --> 19:04.430
Because you’re...

19:04.430 --> 19:08.230
I’m... I’m Ayako’s boyfriend!

19:10.210 --> 19:12.130
Amazing, Mamoru!

19:12.920 --> 19:15.370
Yes, that’s it.

19:15.370 --> 19:16.510
If you...

19:17.480 --> 19:20.710
If you’re with me, I’m...

19:21.550 --> 19:23.290
I’m invincible!

19:24.010 --> 19:24.980
Ayako!

19:50.860 --> 19:55.680
We’ll call the direction of the power applied to the beatrice “x”...

19:55.680 --> 19:58.070
That’s enough for today.

19:59.850 --> 20:05.790
It’s kind of nice to have class under an open sky.

20:08.630 --> 20:13.390
I didn’t think blast would reach the school building...

20:19.200 --> 20:24.010
Witch Beatrice, I was going to take you back to Germany with me, but...

20:24.010 --> 20:27.370
<i>Return to the Beginning </i>needs
to be completely remade.

20:27.370 --> 20:32.770
It’s far too arrogant to expect me to go
without completed preparations.

20:32.770 --> 20:34.140
I see.

20:34.140 --> 20:36.750
Then, when everything’s ready,

20:36.750 --> 20:38.220
I...

20:38.220 --> 20:41.190
I’ll go with you.

20:41.190 --> 20:44.290
I’ll help Ayako-san.

20:44.290 --> 20:48.420
I’m not giving her to you.

20:48.980 --> 20:49.970
Mamoru.

20:51.940 --> 20:53.400
All right.

20:53.400 --> 20:55.290
Then struggle.

20:55.290 --> 20:59.440
Despair at your lack of ability to reach me.

20:59.440 --> 21:02.110
Despair, wail, and cry.

21:02.110 --> 21:05.080
Each time, I’ll laugh at you.

21:05.080 --> 21:06.580
Johan, you...

21:06.580 --> 21:12.540
No matter what you say, Ayako is my girlfriend.

21:15.410 --> 21:16.710
You...

21:18.570 --> 21:20.960
Emelenzia, take me to the airport.

21:20.960 --> 21:22.430
Right!

21:29.960 --> 21:31.450
That’s right.

21:31.450 --> 21:34.490
I’m going to become worthy of her.

21:35.260 --> 21:36.290
I will.

21:41.040 --> 21:42.170
I will!

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:15.180 --> 23:17.000
Our boss is the best in the world!

23:17.040 --> 23:19.040
She’s a celebrity who loves sweets, especially éclairs!

23:19.080 --> 23:21.250
Her silver nose-hairs are really cool!

23:21.300 --> 23:24.630
Hey, you jerk! Our boss doesn’t have visible nose hair!

23:24.670 --> 23:26.430
Sorry, sorry...

23:26.430 --> 23:28.100
I just meant hair.

23:28.220 --> 23:32.260
But you know, her hair and her nose hair
might be the same color...

23:34.250 --> 23:35.960
Silver nose hair!

23:35.960 --> 23:39.440
How divine you are, boss!

23:39.470 --> 23:43.980
The Most Beautiful Hair in the World

23:39.560 --> 23:43.520
Next time: The Most Beautiful Hair in the World
